		"description": "Comprehensive testing collection for the Event Planner Payments Service through the API Gateway. This collection includes all payment processing endpoints, transaction management, and financial reporting features.\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the base URL environment variable (see below)\n3. Follow the testing sequence in order\n\n## Environment Variables:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080 (API Gateway URL)\n- `auth_token`: JWT token from Auth Service (set after login)\n- `payment_id`: Will be set automatically after creating a payment\n- `event_id`: Event ID for testing (set manually or from Event Service)\n\n## Testing Sequence:\n1. Start with Health Check\n2. Test Swagger UI access\n3. Test OpenAPI documentation\n4. Test direct access (should fail)\n5. Test X-Internal-Auth mechanism",
